{"u": "10776176370", "name": "RO-CAM [1MILLIONVISITS]", "place": "72746154142907", "created": "2026-11-12", "updated": "2026-11-27T18:06:57.435Z", "genre": "Shooter", "subgenre": "Deathmatch Shooter", "desc": "🔴 REC\n\nSoft launch to get analytics, expect lots of bugs - me the dev lol\n\nTesting bots on temporarily\n\nOne gun. One life. No crosshair.\n\nRO-CAM is a 6v6 shooter that plays like helmet-cam footage. The camera shakes, reloads take both hands, and if you want to know how many rounds you have left, you pull the mag and look.\n\n▸ ELIMINATION: die and you watch the rest through a teammate's camera. First to 4 rounds.\n▸ TDM, FFA, GUN GAME for when you just want to shoot.\n▸ ZOMBIES: vote it in, then try to last in a ghost town at night. Most squads don't.\n▸ 30+ GUNS. Everyone starts with a Hi-Point. Earn the rest.\n▸ SQUAD UP in the lobby and you always land on the same team.\n▸ VOTE the map, and day or night. Night means flashlights. They can see yours too.\n▸ Warm up on the range. Dress your operator: kits, patches, helmets, vests.\n\n🎁 Join \"shlop games\" for +10% Marks (linked below)\n⭐ VIP: 2x Marks.\n\nBETA. Things will break. Tell us in the Feedback tab, we read all of it.", "desc_hash": "48e4e3cf62be", "max_players": 12, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR6", "visits": 1527168, "favorites": 19585, "creator": {"id": 1536884669, "name": "ShlopShlopz", "type": "User", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-27": {"updated": "2026-11-27T18:06:57.435Z", "visits": 1527168, "fav": 19585, "up": 5570, "down": 1389}}, "passes": [{"name": "Sidearm Slot", "price": 299}, {"name": "Own Avatar", "price": 399}, {"name": "VIP", "price": 299}, {"name": "JBL Speaker", "price": 399}, {"name": "Supporter", "price": 99}, {"name": "Street Weapons", "price": 249}, {"name": "Shotguns", "price": 399}, {"name": "Snipers", "price": 449}, {"name": "Pistols", "price": 549}, {"name": "SMGs", "price": 649}, {"name": "Rifles", "price": 899}], "products": [{"name": "M